      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer returns green product or recycling event
Frequency: Ad-hoc returns; quarterly events
Volume: 200 stores
Owner: Customer Service Rep
Participants: Customer Service Rep, Sustainability Coordinator, Store Manager
Source: workflow W2730 — Sustainable Product Return &amp; Recycling Program</bpmn:documentation>
