        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer Service processes returns per policy; additionally assesses recyclability: LED → recycling partner, paint → hazwaste vendor, fixtures → manufacturer take-back
Responsible (R): Customer Service Rep
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: Per return</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2730_Flow11</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2730_Flow12</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2730_Task6" name="Sustainability Coordinator organizes quarterly events: collection of old…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: Sustainability Coordinator organizes quarterly events: collection of old fixtures, lighting, electronics for recycling; LGU partnership; loyalty points incentive
Responsible (R): Sustainability Coordinator / Store Manager
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2730_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2730_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2730_Task7" name="Coordinator reports end-of-life metrics: return rate (green vs. conventional)…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Coordinator reports end-of-life metrics: return rate (green vs. conventional), recycling rate, event participation; identifies product design and take-back improvements
Responsible (R): Sustainability Coordinator
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2730_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2730_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
