      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly pipeline review
Frequency: Monthly
Volume: ~20–30 active green projects
Owner: Trade Sales Manager
Participants: Trade Sales Mgr, Sustainability Coordinator, FP&amp;A
Source: workflow W2731 — Green Building Project Pipeline Management</bpmn:documentation>
