      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2731_Task6" name="Trade Sales Manager maintains pipeline: project name, developer, certification…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Trade Sales Manager maintains pipeline: project name, developer, certification target, estimated value, stage (quoted/won/in-progress/completed), probability-weighted forecast
Responsible (R): Trade Sales Manager
Accountable (A): VP Merchandising
Duration: Ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2731_Flow12</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2731_Flow13</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2731_Task7" name="FP&amp;A tracks revenue: actual vs. forecast, green as % of total project revenue…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 2: FP&amp;A tracks revenue: actual vs. forecast, green as % of total project revenue (target: 15–20%), green margin vs. conventional; identifies growth trends
Responsible (R): FP&amp;A
Accountable (A): CFO
Duration: Monthly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2731_Flow13</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2731_Flow14</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2731_Task8" name="Sustainability Coordinator reports ESG contribution: BERDE/LEED projects…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 3: Sustainability Coordinator reports ESG contribution: BERDE/LEED projects supplied, environmental impact, green revenue growth; includes in annual ESG report
Responsible (R): Sustainability Coordinator
Accountable (A): COO
Duration: Quarterly</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2731_Flow14</bpmn:incoming>
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2731_Flow15</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:userTask>
